          <p>
            To put that in context, $2.06 per 25 g is competitive for a plant protein. Budget pea and rice powders from warehouse clubs often land well under $2, while premium organic or certified brands commonly cost $2.50 to $3.50. The catch is that you only reach PlantFusion's best price by committing to a 75-serving bag before you know whether you like the taste, which is why the free sample offer on the brand site, two single-serve packets for the cost of shipping, is worth using first.
